# What `vercel deploy` from site/ leaves out.
#
# The tester pages and their functions (Request K / U) need the owner's GitHub
# token and tester keys in Vercel's environment first (docs/COLLAB_SETUP.md).
# Until then they would only show errors, so the public site is the front door
# and the 404 page. Delete these three lines when the Collab setup is done.
beta/
collab/
api/

# The old PyInstaller build. Windows Smart App Control blocks it; the zip that
# ships is NyxIchos-Windows.zip, built by build_release.py.
downloads/NyxIchos-windows-x64.zip
ichnos-512.png
ichnos.png
package.json

# Local-only: the CLI's project link and any env file it writes.
.vercel
.env*
.gitignore
.vercelignore
